    "Kvikkshot works entirely on this Mac and never connects to the internet. Screenshots are kept in a private temporary folder and deleted when you go back or quit — only what you export or save is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kvikkshot works entirely on this Mac and never connects to the internet. Screenshots are kept in a private temporary folder and deleted when you go back or quit — only what you export or save is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kvikkshot 完全在这台 Mac 上运行，从不联网。截图只存放在私有的临时文件夹里，返回首页或退出时就会删除，只有你导出或存储的文件才会保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kvikkshot 完全在這台 Mac 上執行，從不連線上網。截圖只存放在私有的暫存檔案夾裡，返回首頁或結束時就會刪除，只有你匯出或儲存的檔案才會保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
